<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT NEW ZEALAND BY 11 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT NEW ZEALAND BY 11 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>GUJRANWALA, Pakistan 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan beat New Zealand by 11 runs in their first one-day match reduced to 46 overs-a-side on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Pakistan 228-8, New Zealand 217.</p>
